{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X的感受线索明显更密，尤其S02、S04、S11、S13，短时间内容易让观众顾着追踪不断出现的细节；Y的双栏短词更容易快速扫过。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分栏和短词布局更利于快速浏览，但X用加亮的关键语句建立了清楚的注意力落点，又把感受拆成与音乐进程对应的细节，观众更容易抓住每一段真正发生了什么。尤其在人物心理变化、前后因果和情绪转折上，X不仅告诉观众他在高兴、害怕或舍不得，还呈现了这些感受如何产生、如何相互冲突，以及怎样一步步改变。X的水面、摇荡、光线、声音等意象也形成了贯穿始终的体验，因此整体叙事和感受细腻度明显胜出。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7550adcc-9b17-413e-97e2-15b36715c4d0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T045357611077Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T04:54:45.088395+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5e4faa649e74adaabbefa6c2c9900fae066097097d924d76aa60680114eb3070", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "